# Vanessa Automation Diagnostics Policy

> RULES — mandatory source priorities for diagnostics after a failed scenario run.

## Purpose

This rule states that the agent must use Vanessa Automation's event log as the main diagnostics source and identifies which sources should not be substituted with heavier tools without necessity.

## MUST

| Requirement | Description |
|------------|-------------|
| Event Log first | The primary error source is the registration log (`event-log`) |
| Tech log last | Use the technical log only if the `event-log` and visual diagnostics did not provide an answer |
| Account for timezone drift | Do not rely blindly on local time windows: ClickHouse and local time may differ |

